      190.29,
      228.53,
      373.29,
      252.47
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PROVINCIAL COUNCILS(TRANSFER OF STAMP DUTY) ACT, NO. 13 OF 2011",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      266.33,
      401.9,
      290.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      301.49,
      401.88,
      325.43
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Provincial Councils(Transfer of Stamp Duty) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      336.77,
      401.89,
      360.71
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Provincial Councils (Transfer of StampDuty) Act, No. 13 of 2011 is hereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      371.93,
      401.87,
      395.87
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the renumbering of section 2 as subsection (1)of that section;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      407.09,
      401.87,
      443.63
    ],
    "text": "(2)in renumbered subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution for the words \u201crevenue so collected.\u201d,of the following words:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      454.97,
      289.31,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201crevenue so collected:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      477.53,
      401.88,
      514.07
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, any person who proves to thesatisfaction of the Commissioner-General by a claimmade in writing that he has paid any stamp duty\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      210.57,
      525.29,
      401.85,
      549.23
    ],
    "text": "(a) in excess of the amount properly payableby him; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      210.57,
      560.57,
      401.9,
      622.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) erroneously on an instrument to which suchstamp duty relates and is found that he wasnot liable to pay such stamp duty under theprovisions of the Stamp Duty (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 12 of 2006,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      633.53,
      401.87,
      670.07
    ],
    "text": "shall be refunded the amount so paid, out of anyamount collected as stamp duty during any periodprior to transfer to the Provincial Councils.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      355.14,
      190.31
    ],
    "text": "Provincial Councils(Transfer of Stamp Duty) (Amendment)2",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      145.87,
      265.97,
      150.87,
      277.31
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      203.33,
      397.17,
      227.51
    ],
    "text": "(3)by the addition immediately after renumberedsubsection (1) of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      239.21,
      397.16,
      276.59
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) The provisions of section 11 of the StampDuty (Special Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 2006 shallapply to all claims for refund under this section.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      288.17,
      397.18,
      338.51
    ],
    "text": "(3) For the purpose of this section,\u201cCommissioner-General\u201d shall have the samemeaning as in the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of2017.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      350.21,
      397.2,
      373.91
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      352.27,
      450.44,
      390.14
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
